{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01U1cwaZ9p3Cg5J7n1M1ba97","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good. Now I have all the data for the report. Let me compile the comparison table:\n\n| Metric | Baseline | Before Task | After Task | vs Baseline | vs Before |\n|--------|----------|-------------|------------|-------------|-----------|\n| **APC 300** | | | | | |\n| STARK excl trace | 2455ms | 1308ms | 1288ms | -1167ms, 1.91x lower | -20ms, 1.02x lower |\n| MLE Rounds | 180ms | 171ms | 161ms | -19ms, 1.12x lower | -10ms, 1.06x lower |\n| **APC 0** | | | | | |\n| STARK excl trace | 2153ms | 2157ms | 2130ms | -23ms, 1.01x lower | -27ms, 1.01x lower |\n| MLE Rounds | 118ms | 114ms | 113ms | -5ms, 1.04x lower | -1ms, 1.01x lower |\n\nNow let me write the report and update the log."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1495,"cache_read_input_tokens":149280,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1495},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2c41f48-5b80-4de8-b307-355a7b8c0ec2","uuid":"2f6d8b2b-556c-4ce9-8c5f-d43e2b14bd58"}
